      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 3.29,
          "en": "In the last lecture,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.29,
          "end": 5.88,
          "en": "we worked on a bare workflow project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.88,
          "end": 8.29,
          "en": "which we created with Expo in it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.29,
          "end": 10.61,
          "en": "However, sometimes you might also work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.61,
          "end": 14.48,
          "en": "on a managed workflow project and at some point you decide",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.48,
          "end": 16.82,
          "en": "that you wanna switch to the bare workflow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.82,
          "end": 19.36,
          "en": "because you need more configurability,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.36,
          "end": 23.11,
          "en": "you wanna add native code for such reasons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.11,
          "end": 24.81,
          "en": "And the great thing about Expo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.81,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "is that you can eject from the managed workflow",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 31.89,
          "en": "to the bare workflow anytime you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.89,
          "end": 34.01,
          "en": "And that's exactly what we'll do here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.01,
          "end": 36.77,
          "en": "Here, I have this Expense app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.77,
          "end": 38.84,
          "en": "which we built as part of the course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.84,
          "end": 42.02,
          "en": "not the finished version with the https on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 42.02,
          "end": 45.98,
          "en": "but the first version which had some basic screens",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.98,
          "end": 48.99,
          "en": "and where we could navigate around and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.99,
          "end": 50.82,
          "en": "Now let's say that for some reason,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 50.82,
          "end": 53.47,
          "en": "we wanna switch to the bare workflow.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 53.47,
          "end": 56.32,
          "en": "Doing so is super simple.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 56.32,
          "end": 59.77,
          "en": "All we have to do here is open our terminal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.77,
          "end": 61.33,
          "en": "and then in this project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.33,
          "end": 64.3,
          "en": "which again is a managed workflow project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.3,
          "end": 66.093,
          "en": "we can run expo eject.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.15,
          "end": 69.47,
          "en": "And what this will do is it will ask us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.47,
          "end": 71.37,
          "en": "if we really wanna continue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 71.37,
          "end": 76.06,
